      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Summary of what you did\nExplanation of why you did it\nA description of how to test the changes\n\nThe PR explains how code works across a feature/component\n\nSize of the PR (lines of code) Keep it relatively concise\nif the feature starts to grow consider 2 or more PRs instead of 1\n\nGood labeling/connection to the rest of your management stuff\n(closes #issue, links to relevant prior PRs, etc.)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Summary of what you did\nExplanation of why you did it\nA description of how to test the changes\n\nThe PR explains how code works across a feature/component\n\nSize of the PR (lines of code) Keep it relatively concise\nif the feature starts to grow consider 2 or more PRs instead of 1\n\nGood labeling/connection to the rest of your management stuff\n(closes #issue, links to relevant prior PRs, etc.)",
